WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.500
Narrator: Minute seventy-five.

2
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:06.200
Radio: (the stand-by code word - a short tone)

3
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:09.100
Narrator: A message comes over the radio.

4
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:12.800
Narrator: Majed doesn't recognise it, so he does nothing.

5
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Narrator: Noura recognises it at once - and she's already at her exit.

6
00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:31.000
Narrator: One of them is ready if the stand has to empty.

